{574}{}{Well, congratulations, Mayor. It's time for me to go.}
{575}{}{I need to see him. Maybe I can learn something from him.}
{576}{}{He's downstairs, locked up. Tell the guards to let you through.}
{577}{}{You grabbed the wrong guy. He needs to be released.}
