{583}{}{I, well, um... worked with him in the same caravan. I can guarantee that he poses no threat to you.}
{584}{}{Hmm. To be honest, I don't know who he is or where he comes from, but residents always see a stranger as an enemy. Okay, I'll let this guy go for now, but on the condition that he leaves my city within the hour.}
{585}{}{Thanks, Mr. Mayor.}
