{587}{}{Sounds reasonable. But tell him to get out of town within the hour.}
{588}{}{Thanks, Mr. Mayor.}
{589}{}{Sounds reasonable.}
{590}{}{I'll drop off the caps shortly.}
{591}{}{The Blue Shields propose an alliance. They've already made an agreement with the Tinsmiths.}
{592}{}{What? Are these highwaymen protected by the Tinsmiths? That's outrageous!}
