{596}{}{Obviously so. I will sign the contract, taking into account your past achievements. But I'm gonna do everything to make the Shields pay dearly for it.}
{597}{}{I'll tell Ben what you said. Goodbye.}
{598}{}{I'll be damned if I sign onto some 'alliance'. Get out and tell Ben that the Tinsmiths won't be able to protect him and his gang from justice.}
{599}{}{I'll tell Ben what you said. Goodbye.}
